    "title": "Macy's Has a 'Festive' Cat Sweater on Sale for Just $25 During Its Early Black Friday Sale - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By EnJanae’ Taylor ,\n26 minutes ago\nParade aims to feature only the best products and services. If you buy something via one of our links, we may earn a commission.\nIt’s the perfect weather to cuddle up with your cats on the couch and watch Christmas movies. Though it’s hard to leave them at home, especially as it gets colder out, you can show your love for your furry friends with this cat crewneck . Right now, you can get this kitten-covered Christmas sweater exclusively at Macy’s for 50% off during its early Black Friday sale.\nThe Holiday Lane Kitten Sleigh Crewneck Sweater is on sale now for $25. It features “adorable” black cats in the place of reindeer, guiding Santa’s sleigh. Santa sits in his felt sleigh, wearing his red suit, while the cats wear reindeer ears, beanies, and Santa hats. They’re linked by a gold string of colorful Christmas lights made of sequins. The whole merry scene is surrounded by embroidered white snowflakes.\nHoliday Lane Kitten Sleigh Crewneck Sweater, $25 (was $50) at Macy’s The crewneck comes in green and red, both wonderful options for Christmas. The regular sizes range from XS to XXL, while the petite sizes range from XS to XL. Each sweater is approximately 25 inches long, and shoppers appreciated that though it was “comfortable” to wear, it still had a “flattering” fit. The retailer recommends sizing down for an exact fit. The long-sleeve sweater is made of 100% acrylic, to keep you nice and “warm.” It’s also machine washable, making cleaning easy.\nRelated: Amazon Has a 'Cozy' and 'Warm' Crewneck Sweater on Sale for Just $26\n“I have worn and washed it three times this holiday season, and it is holding up well,” one shopper said.\nThe cat-forward sweater is “perfect” for a Christmas party, and shoppers also had “fun” wearing the “festive” sweater to work during the holiday season. The long-lasting design will allow you to wear it for many years.\nShop More Deals Prepare for Christmas with this “cute” cat crewneck. Pick up the Holiday Lane Kitten Sleigh Crewneck Sweater for only $25 at Macy’s.\nDon’t miss future deals! Sign up for Parade Picks to receive our commerce team’s curated selection of discounts and sales, twice a week.",
